  "prompt": "Which products are in the top 2 of their category by 2025 net revenue? Use the sales rows whose order_date falls in 2025 (order_date is a UTC day). Products that tie on revenue share a place, and the place after a tie is skipped, so a tie for second place keeps both products. Return four columns, in this order: category_name, product_id, revenue and revenue_rank. Return one row for each product kept. Any row order is fine.",
